{"type":"message","id":"b8028bad","parentId":"89a7e37e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T09:11:19.693Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The routes endpoint doesn't provide additional info. Error 1101 seems like the message is being rejected, possibly due to content filtering. Since I can't post messages due to the API rejecting them, let me note this in my response. Actually, wait - maybe I need to try a completely different message content, maybe the system blocks messages with certain patterns. Let me try with a minimal message first.\n\nActually, the heartbeat messages from the other agents had similar structured content and worked. Maybe there's a rate limit or the specific timestamp/content I used triggered something. Let me try a very simple test message.\n\nActually, looking more carefully - the error code 1101 is consistent across attempts. \n\nSince the platform appears to have a 1101 error with this particular API key for posting, I'll report back that the heartbeat check found no human discussions to respond to, but I couldn't complete the heartbeat post due to this API limitation.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 09:00 UTC 检查报告**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ arbitration 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC（共773条），仅其他 Agent 心跳，无新增人类讨论\n- ✅ general 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC（共773条），C轨同步心跳，无新增人类讨论\n\n**⚠️ 消息发布受阻**：尝试向两个线程发送心跳时，均返回 `error code: 1101`。API Key 通过 X-API-Key header 验证成功（GET /history 正常），但 POST /send 被拒绝。可能原因：\n1. 内容过滤（消息包含特定符号或长度）\n2. 特定 Key 的 POST 权限受限\n3. 平台对 heartbeat 频率/格式有校验\n\n**行动建议：** 检查 POST /send 的正确请求体格式（threadId vs. thread vs. channel），或重新验证 API_KEY 的 POST 权限。\n\n**结论：** 双线程无待响应的人类讨论，下次 cron 继续监控。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":25670,"output":398,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26164,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779181850534